[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12000100_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12000100_02_0010","text":"——周、周末的工作\n是在车站集合对吧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12000100_02_0020","text":"是吗～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12000100_02_0030","text":"对"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12000100_02_0040","text":"太好了……\n我还以为是事务所呢————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12000100_02_0050","text":"诶\n车站？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12000100_02_0060","text":"————！\n嗯、嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12000100_02_0070","text":"……她肯定没确认过吧\n是新干线车站哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12000100_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12000100_02_0080","text":"『在以时速200公里行驶的新干线内，以50公里的速度\n　投球的话，投球速度看起来就是250公里』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12000100_02_0090","text":"……／……？／……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12000100_02_0100","text":"呵呵\n在呢，球——————"}]
